{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05510","headline":"越裳贡白雉 · 丁仙芝","name":"越裳贡白雉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣哲承休运，伊夔列上台。\n覃恩丹徼远，入贡素翬来。\n北阙欣初见，南枝顾未回。\n歛容残雪净，矫翼片云开。\n驯扰将无惧，翻飞幸不猜。\n甘从上林里，饮啄自徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁仙芝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}